@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60
title Package diagram: Municipal report management application, code packages and layers

package "Boundary\n(presentation: Swing screens)" as screens {
}
package "Control\n(application: use-case controllers)" as controllers {
}
package "Entity\n(domain: entities and services)" as domain {
}
package "Database\n(persistence: JPA access)" as storage {
}
package "jakarta.persistence\n(JPA API, external)" as jpa <<muted>> {
}
hide <<muted>> stereotype

note right of screens
  Seven of ten screens enter Control
  through the SystemServicesController
  facade; the login screen uses its
  login controller directly, and two
  screens call no controller.
end note
note left of domain
  JPA-annotated domain classes and
  the report and user services live
  here; the services call Database
  directly. Layers exchange Map data
  instead of domain objects.
end note

screens ..> controllers : calls controllers
screens ..> domain : uses ReportCategory
controllers ..> domain : calls services, enum
domain ..> storage : stores data
domain ..> jpa : maps with annotations
storage ..> jpa : accesses via
@enduml
